{"schema":1,"kind":"interactive","date":"2026-02-11","title":"📊 Interactive Nightly Report: 2026-02-11","metrics":[],"blocks":[{"html":"<main role=\"main\"><div class=\"data-richness\">\n🎉 DATA RICHNESS: 86% (120 of 140 fields)\n<div class=\"data-richness-bar\"><div class=\"data-richness-fill\" style=\"width: 85.71428571428571%;\">\n+105 new fields vs v2.0!\n</div></div></div><section class=\"note\" role=\"complementary\" aria-label=\"Report information\"><strong>🚀 Interactive Workout Cards v3.0 - COMPREHENSIVE DATA EDITION</strong><br>\nThis report now displays <strong>8x more data</strong> than previous version! New features:\n<ul><li>💓 <strong>Heart Rate Zones</strong> with visual bar chart breakdown</li><li>🏃 <strong>Training Effect</strong> indicators (Recovery/Tempo/Threshold)</li><li>👟 <strong>Running Form Metrics</strong> grid (cadence, stride, vertical oscillation, contact time)</li><li>💪 <strong>Speediance Details</strong> (finish time, efficiency ratio, cal/min, volume/exercise)</li><li>💚 <strong>WHOOP Recovery Integration</strong> showing recovery score + HRV trends</li><li>📊 <strong>Training Load</strong> + intensity minutes + hydration estimates</li><li>⚡ <strong>Power Metrics</strong> (avg/max/normalized power for runs)</li><li>🎯 <strong>Multi-Source Correlations</strong> (workout impact on recovery)</li></ul><div class=\"keyboard-shortcuts\"><strong>Keyboard Shortcuts:</strong><br>\n• <code>Tab</code> - Navigate between cards<br>\n• <code>Enter</code> or <code>Space</code> - Expand/collapse focused card<br>\n• <code>Shift+E</code> - Expand/collapse all cards\n</div></section><section aria-label=\"Daily summary\"><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card summary-card\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Daily summary\"><div class=\"card-header\">📊 DAILY TOTALS</div><div class=\"summary-stats\"><div class=\"summary-item\"><span class=\"summary-label\">Total Time</span><span class=\"summary-value\">18:12</span></div><div class=\"summary-item\"><span class=\"s