rt rate zones, training effect, form metrics, power)</li><li><strong>WHOOP:</strong> 500 recovery records integrated (recovery score, HRV, RHR trends)</li><li><strong>Historical:</strong> 24 workouts loaded for comparisons</li></ul><h4>🆕 New Fields in v3.0:</h4><ul><li><strong>Heart Rate Zones (Garmin):</strong> Time in Zone 1-5 with % breakdown</li><li><strong>Training Effect (Garmin):</strong> Aerobic/Anaerobic scores + labels</li><li><strong>Running Form (Garmin):</strong> Cadence, stride length, VO, GCT, vertical ratio</li><li><strong>Power Metrics (Garmin):</strong> Average, max, normalized power</li><li><strong>Training Load (Garmin):</strong> Cumulative fatigue tracking</li><li><strong>Intensity Minutes (Garmin):</strong> Moderate + vigorous for WHO goals</li><li><strong>Hydration (Garmin):</strong> Estimated water loss</li><li><strong>Body Battery (Garmin):</strong> Workout impact on energy</li><li><strong>Speediance Efficiency:</strong> Actual vs planned duration with % ratio</li><li><strong>Speediance Finish Time:</strong> Exact workout completion timestamp</li><li><strong>Speediance Intensity:</strong> Calories per minute, volume per exercise</li><li><strong>WHOOP Recovery:</strong> Recovery score, HRV, RHR with daily trends</li><li><strong>Multi-Source:</strong> Recovery context on workout cards</li></ul><h4>📈 Data Richness Improvement:</h4><ul><li><strong>v2.0:</strong> ~15 fields displayed (11% of available data)</li><li><strong>v3.0:</strong> ~120 fields displayed (86% of available data)</li><li><strong>Improvement:</strong> +105 fields (75% increase)</li></ul></section></main>"},{"html":"<footer role=\"contentinfo\" style=\"margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #2c2c2e; text-align: center; color: #8e8e93; font-size: 12px;\">\nGenerated by Interactive Nightly Report Generator v3.0 - COMPREHENSIVE DATA EDITION<br>\nEnhanced with RAW Garmin parsing, WHOOP integration, and 8x more data fields\n</footer>"}]}
